cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "privateassets: multi-factor money-weighted PME for private-asset cash flows"
abstract: >-
  Estimates risk-adjusted alpha and systematic factor exposures directly from
  private-asset cash flows, generalising Direct Alpha, KS-PME and GPME from a
  single benchmark to a tradable multi-factor deflator.
type: software
authors:
